# the cheat sheet's flows (web/cheat/flows.html): each board's screens, Skellig from power-on: the Lead's page, then a
# click of ALGORITHM on each layer, PERFORM and the way out of it, GLO's save and reset;
# build/host/amb_host tests/listen/flowshots.amb OUT, then OUT/flow-*.png to docs/img, squeezed (lossless): the host writes them uncompressed
wait 6300
tap LFO
wait 400
shot flow-lead-page.png
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-lead-voice.png
wait 1500
tap ENV
wait 400
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-drone-voice.png
wait 1500
tap ARP
wait 400
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-seq-voice.png
wait 1500
tap SEQ
wait 400
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-seq2-voice.png
wait 1500
tap SAVE
wait 400
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-atmos-char.png
wait 1500
tap EDIT
wait 400
turn ALGO 1
wait 150
shot flow-walk.png
wait 1500
tap SEL
wait 1500
shot flow-perform.png
tap LFO
wait 400
shot flow-perform-off.png
wait 2500
press GLO
wait 900
release GLO
wait 200
shot flow-saved.png
wait 2500
press GLO
wait 1800
shot flow-reset.png
release GLO
wait 400
